></div></div></div></div></div><div class="r-primary-title flex column no-wrap justify-center items-center" data-v-22d48c6f data-v-36214abe><h2 class="r-primary text-center" data-v-36214abe>丰富的功能，促进多维度思考</h2><p class="text-center r-body" data-v-36214abe>记、连、忆、用，关于笔记的每一步都精心雕琢。不仅是信息的记录，更是思考的催化。</p></div><div class="r-block flex column fit" data-v-22d48c6f><div class="r-section flex column no-wrap items-center fit" data-v-22d48c6f><div class="r-secondary-title flex column no-wrap items-start justify-center" style="width:100%;height:100%;" data-v-22d48c6f><h2 class="r-secondary">轻松的记录</h2></div><div class="r-cards flex row justify-between fit" data-v-22d48c6f><div class="r-feature-card-plus r-card-with-outer-desc flex column no-wrap items-start" style="width:100%;height:100%;" data-v-22d48c6f><div class="r-feature-img" style="width:100%;height:100%;max-width:100%;max-height:auto;"><div class="q-img q-img--menu" style="" role="img" aria-label><div style="padding-bottom:56.24929688378895%;"></div><div class="q-img__content absolute-full q-anchor--skip"><div class="flex column no-wrap fit transparent text-black"><!--[--><!--]--></div></div></div></div><div class="r-text flex column no-wrap"><!----><h4>多功能编辑器，支持丰富多样的记录</h4></div></div><div class="r-feature-card-plus r-card-with-outer-desc flex column no-wrap items-start" style="width:100%;height:100%;" data-v-22d48c6f><div class="r-feature-img" style="width:100%;height:100%;max-width:100%;max-height:auto;"><div class="q-img q-img--menu" style="" role="img" aria-label><div style="padding-bottom:56.24929688378895%;"></div><div class="q-img__content absolute-full q-anchor--skip"><div class="flex column no-wrap fit transparent text-black"><!--[--><!--]--></div></div></div></div><div class="r-text flex column no-wrap"><!----><h4>多场景捕捉灵感，随时记录闪念</h4></div></div></div></div><div class="r-section flex column no-wrap items-center fit" data-v-22d48c6f><div class="r-secondary-title flex column no-wrap items-start justify-center" style="width:100%;height:100%;" data-v-22d48c6f><h2 class="r-secondary">多样的连接</h2></div><div class="r-cards flex row justify-between fit" data-v-22d48c6f><div class="r-feature-card-plus r-card-with-outer-desc flex column no-wrap items-start" style="width:100%;height:100%;" data-v-22d48c6f><div class="r-feature-img" style="width:100%;height:100%;max-width:100%;max-height:auto;"><div class="q-img q-img--menu" style="" role="img" aria-label><div style="padding-bottom:56.24929688378895%;"></div><div class="q-img__content absolute-full q-anchor--skip"><div class="flex column no-wrap fit transparent text-black"><!--[--><!--]--></div></div></div></div><div class="r-text flex column no-wrap"><h4 class="r-primary">全局星图</h4><h4>网状呈现笔记关系，知识结构尽收眼底</h4></div></div><div class="r-feature-card-plus r-card-with-outer-desc flex column no-wrap items-start" style="width:100%;height:100%;" data-v-22d48c6f><div class="r-feature-img" style="width:100%;height:100%;max-width:100%;max-height:auto;"><div class="q-img q-img--menu" style="" role="img" aria-label><div style="padding-bottom:56.24929688378895%;"></div><div class="q-img__content absolute-full q-anchor--skip"><div class="flex column no-wrap fit transparent text-black"><!--[--><!--]--></div></div></div></div><div class="r-text flex column no-wrap"><h4 class="r-primary">局部星图</h4><h4>为笔记建立连接，让思考形成串联</h4></div></div><div class="r-feature-card-plus r-card-with-outer-desc flex column no-wrap items-start" style="width:100%;height:100%;" data-v-22d48c6f><div class="r-feature-img" style="width:100%;height:100%;max-width:100%;max-height:auto;"><div class="q-img q-img--menu" style="" role="img" aria-label><div style="padding-bottom:56.24929688378895%;"></div><div class="q-img__content absolute-full q-anchor--skip"><div class="flex column no-wrap fit transparent text-black"><!--[--><!--]--></div></div></div></div><div class="r-text flex column no-wrap"><h4 class="r-primary">相关笔记</h4><h4>智能推荐相关笔记，知识间的连接更紧密</h4></div></div></div></div><div class="r-section flex column no-wrap items-center fit" data-v-22d48c6f><div class="r-secondary-title flex column no-wrap items-start justify-center" style="width:100%;height:100%;" data-v-22d48c6f><h2 class="r-secondary">更好的回顾</h2></div><div class="r-cards flex row justify-between fit" data-v-22d48c6f><div class="r-feature-card-plus r-card-with-outer-desc flex column no-wrap items-start" style="width:100%;height:100%;" data-v-22d48c6f><div class="r-feature-img" style="width:100%;height:100%;max-width:100%;max-height:auto;"><div class="q-img q-img--menu" style="" role="img" aria-label><div style="padding-bottom:56.24929688378895%;"></div><div class="q-img__content absolute-full q-anchor--skip"><div class="flex column no-wrap fit transparent text-black"><!--[--><!--]--></div></div></div></div><div class="r-text flex column no-wrap"><!----><h4>有摩擦的智能回顾，存入难、取出易</h4></div></div><div class="r-feature-card-plus r-card-with-outer-desc flex column no-wrap items-start" style="width:100%;height:100%;" data-v-22d48c6f><div class="r-feature-img" style="width:100%;height:100%;max-width:100%;max-height:auto;"><div class="q-img q-img--menu" style="" role="img" aria-label><div style="padding-bottom:56.24929688378895%;"></div><div class="q-img__content absolute-full q-anchor--skip"><div class="flex column no-wrap fit transparent text-black"><!--[--><!--]--></div></div></div></div><div class="r-text flex column no-wrap"><!----><h4>一键查看答案，回顾无压力</h4></div></div><div class="r-feature-card-plus r-card-with-outer-desc flex column no-wrap items-start" style="width:100%;height:100%;" data-v-22d48c6f><div class="r-feature-img" style="width:100%;height:100%;max-width:100%;max-height:auto;"><div class="q-img q-img--menu" style="" role="img" aria-label><div style="padding-bottom:56.24929688378895%;"></div><div class="q-img__content absolute-full q-anchor--skip"><div class="flex column no-wrap fit transparent text-black"><!--[--><!--]--></div></div></div></div><div class="r-text flex column no-wrap"><!----><h4>回顾加迭代，笔记持续进化</h4></div></div></div></div><div class="r-section flex column no-wrap items-center fit" data-v-22d48c6f><div class="r-secondary-title flex column no-wrap items-start justify-center" style="width:100%;height:100%;" data-v-22d48c6f><h2 class="r-secondary">快捷的调用</h2></div><div class="r-cards flex row justify-between fit" data-v-22d48c6f><div class="r-feature-card-plus r-card-with-outer-desc flex column no-wrap items-start" style="width:100%;height:100%;" data-v-22d48c6f><div class="r-feature-img" style="width:100%;height:100%;max-width:100%;max-height:auto;"><div class="q-img q-img--menu" style="" role="img" aria-label><div style="padding-bottom:56.24929688378895%;"></div><div class="q-img__content absolute-full q-anchor--skip"><div class="flex column no-wrap fit transparent text-black"><!--[--><!--]--></div></div></div></div><div class="r-text flex column no-wrap"><!----><h4>多级标签，信息井然有序</h4></div></div><div class="r-feature-card-plus r-card-with-outer-desc flex column no-wrap items-start" style="width:100%;height:100%;" data-v-22d48c6f><div class="r-feature-img" style="width:100%;height:100%;max-width:100%;max-height:auto;"><div class="q-img q-img--menu" style="" role="img" aria-label><div style="padding-bottom:56.24929688378895%;"></div><div class="q-img__content absolute-full q-anchor--skip"><div class="flex column no-wrap fit transparent text-black"><!--[--><!--]--></div></div></div></div><div class="r-text flex column no-wrap"><!----><h4>关键词搜索，精准抵达</h4></div></div><div class="r-feature-card-plus r-card-with-outer-desc flex column no-wrap items-start" style="width:100%;height:100%;" data-v-22d48c6f><div class="r-feature-img" style="width:100%;height:100%;max-width:100%;max-height:auto;"><div class="q-img q-img--menu" style="" role="img" aria-label><div style="padding-bottom:56.24929688378895%;"></div><div class="q-img__content absolute-full q-anchor--skip"><div class="flex column no-wrap fit transparent text-black"><!--[--><!--]--></div></div></div></div><div class="r-text flex column no-wrap"><!----><h4>多维度链接，多路径发现</h4></div></div><div class="r-feature-card-plus r-card-with-outer-desc flex column no-wrap items-start" style="width:100%;height:100%;" data-v-22d48c6f><div class="r-feature-img" style="width:100%;height:100%;max-width:100%;max-height:auto;"><div class="q-img q-img--menu" style="" role="img" aria-label><div style="padding-bottom:56.24929688378895%;"></div><div class="q-img__content absolute-full q-anchor--skip"><div class="flex column no-wrap fit transparent text-black"><!--[--><!--]--></div></div></div></div><div class="r-text flex column no-wrap"><!----><h4>AI 智能问答，有问题就有好答案</h4></div></div></div></div></div><div class="r-competence-circle r-block flex column no-wrap justify-center items-center window-width" data-v-22d48c6f data-v-5fbedf2d><div class="r-primary-title flex column no-wrap justify-center items-center" data-v-5fbedf2d data-v-36214abe><h2 class="r-primary text-center" data-v-36214abe>reminds 的能力圈</h2><p class="text-center r-body" data-v-36214abe>有所为，有所不为。做好“能力圈”范围内的事，用心服务好每一个用户。</p></div><div class="r-section flex column no-wrap items-center fit" data-v-5fbedf2d><div class="r-item r-cards flex row justify-center items-center full-height" data-v-5fbedf2d><div class="r-text-card flex column no-wrap justify-start self-stretch" style="width:100%;" data-v-5fbedf2d><div class="q-img q-img--menu" style="width:2rem;height:auto;" role="img" data-v-5fbedf2d><div style="padding-bottom:56.24929688378895%;"></div><div class="q-img__content absolute-full q-anchor--skip"></div></div><div class="r-text-card flex column no-wrap justify-between items-stretch r-text-card-inner" style="width:100%;height:auto;max-width:100%;max-height:auto;" data-v-5fbedf2d data-v-6fb2b5e7><div class="r-text flex column no-wrap justify-start items-stretch col-auto" data-v-6fb2b5e7><h4 data-v-6fb2b5e7>面向个人使用</h4><div class="col-grow r-desc" data-v-6fb2b5e7><p>reminds 定位为面向个人使用的卡片笔记工具，因此，在 reminds 内不会有用户间的互动和协作。如果对互动和协作有需求，那 reminds 并不是合适的选择，可能 Notion、飞书文档是更合适的选择。</p></div></div><!----></div></div><div class="r-text-card flex column no-wrap justify-start self-stretch" style="width:100%;" data-v-5fbedf2d><div class="q-img q-img--menu" style="width:2rem;height:auto;" role="img" data-v-5fbedf2d><div style="padding-bottom:56.24929688378895%;"></div><div class="q-img__content absolute-full q-anchor--skip"></div></div><div class="r-text-card flex column no-wrap justify-between items-stretch r-text-card-inner" style="width:100%;height:auto;max-width:100%;max-height:auto;" data-v-5fbedf2d data-v-6fb2b5e7><div class="r-text flex column no-wrap justify-start items-stretch col-auto" data-v-6fb2b5e7><h4 data-v-6fb2b5e7>为短小的卡片而生</h4><div class="col-grow r-desc" data-v-6fb2b5e7><p>卡片笔记的定位，意味着 reminds 内的所有体验都是为短小的卡片记录而设计和优化的，400 字以内为最佳。如果对写长文有需求，那 reminds 并不是合适的选择，可能 Obsidian、Notion 是更合适的选择。</p></div></div><!----></div></div><div class="r-text-card flex column no-wrap justify-start self-stretch" style="width:100%;" data-v-5fbedf2d><div class="q-img q-img--menu" style="width:2rem;height:auto;" role="img" data-v-5fbedf2d><div style="padding-bottom:56.24929688378895%;"></div><div class="q-img__content absolute-full q-anchor--skip"></div></div><div class="r-text-card flex column no-wrap justify-between items-stretch r-text-card-inner" style="width:100%;height:auto;max-width:100%;max-height:auto;" data-v-5fbedf2d data-v-6fb2b5e7><div class="r-text flex column no-wrap justify-start items-stretch col-auto" data-v-6fb2b5e7><h4 data-v-6fb2b5e7>做可靠的 AI</h4><div class="col-grow r-desc" data-v-6fb2b5e7><p>reminds MindPilot 选择只做基于笔记内容的可靠 AI，这样的选择，就决定了 MindPilot 有时候可能给不出答案，因为笔记里没有找到相关的内容。持续不断记录， 笔记越多，MindPilot 就会越智能。</p></div></div><!----></div></div></div></div></div><div class="r-primary-title flex column no-wrap justify-center items-center" data-v-22d48c6f data-v-36214abe><h2 class="r-primary text-center" data-v-36214abe>热爱思考的学习者</h2><p class="text-center r-body" data-v-36214abe>在阅读、学习、和灵光乍现的每时每刻，和你一起进化，永远孜孜不倦地记录着。</p></div><swiper-container class="r-scenario-carousel" init="false" data-v-22d48c6f data-v-06b1c7fa><!--[--><swiper-slide data-v-06b1c7fa><div class="r-scenario-card flex row no-wrap justify-between no-scroll" style="" data-v-06b1c7fa data-v-46fc4301><div class="r-feature-img" style="width:100%;height:auto;max-width:100%;max-height:auto;" data-v-46fc4301><div class="q-img q-img--menu" style="" role="img" aria-label><div style="padding-bottom:56.24929688378895%;"></div><div class="q-img__content absolute-full q-anchor--skip"><div class="flex column no-wrap fit transparent text-black"><!--[--><div class="r-text flex column no-wrap transparent text-black absolute-bottom" data-v-46fc4301><h4 class="r-primary" data-v-46fc4301>深度阅读者</h4><p data-v-46fc4301>每每读到好书，你总会字字品味，想记下每一句喜欢的话</p></div><!--]--></div></div></div></div></div></swiper-slide><swiper-slide data-v-06b1c7fa><div class="r-scenario-card flex row no-wrap justify-between no-scroll" style="" data-v-06b1c7fa data-v-46fc4301><div class="r-feature-img" style="width:100%;height:auto;max-width:100%;max-height:auto;" data-v-46fc4301><div class="q-img q-img--menu" style="" role="img" aria-label><div style="padding-bottom:56.24929688378895%;"></div><div class="q-img__content absolute-full q-anchor--skip"><div class="flex column no-wrap fit transparent text-black"><!--[--><div class="r-text flex column no-wrap transparent text-black absolute-bottom" data-v-46fc4301><h4 class="r-primary" data-v-46fc4301>好学的求知者</h4><p data-v-46fc4301>对于要精进的领域，向前的每一步都值得被你记录</p></div><!--]--></div></div></div></div></div></swiper-slide><swiper-slide data-v-06b1c7fa><div class="r-scenario-card flex row no-wrap justify-between no-scroll" style="" data-v-06b1c7fa data-v-46fc4301><div class="r-feature-img" style="width:100%;height:auto;max-width:100%;max-height:auto;" data-v-46fc4301><div class="q-img q-img--menu" style="" role="img" aria-label><div style="padding-bottom:56.24929688378895%;"></div><div class="q-img__content absolute-full q-anchor--skip"><div class="flex column no-wrap fit transparent text-black"><!--[--><div class="r-text flex column no-wrap transparent text-black absolute-bottom" data-v-46fc4301><h4 class="r-primary" data-v-46fc4301>捕捉灵感者</h4><p data-v-46fc4301>哪怕是一闪而过的灵感，你也总是选择伸手去抓住</p></div><!--]--></div></div></div></div></div></swiper-slide><swiper-slide data-v-06b1c7fa><div class="r-scenario-card flex row no-wrap justify-between no-scroll" style="" data-v-06b1c7fa data-v-46fc4301><div class="r-feature-img" style="width:100%;height:auto;max-width:100%;max-height:auto;" data-v-46fc4301><div class="q-img q-img--menu" style="" role="img" aria-label><div style="padding-bottom:56.24929688378895%;"></div><div class="q-img__content absolute-full q-anchor--skip"><div class="flex column no-wrap fit transparent text-black"><!--[--><div class="r-text flex column no-wrap transparent text-black absolute-bottom" data-v-46fc4301><h4 class="r-primary" data-v-46fc4301>生活记录者</h4><p data-v-46fc4301>生活的每时每刻，都值得被记录，任何一段过往，于你都是礼物</p></div><!--]--></div></div></div></div></div></swiper-slide><swiper-slide data-v-06b1c7fa><div class="r-scenario-card flex row no-wrap justify-between no-scroll" style="" data-v-06b1c7fa data-v-46fc4301><div class="r-feature-img" style="width:100%;height:auto;max-width:100%;max-height:auto;" data-v-46fc4301><div class="q-img q-img--menu" style="" role="img" aria-label><div style="padding-bottom:56.24929688378895%;"></div><div class="q-img__content absolute-full q-anchor--skip"><div class="flex column no-wrap fit transparent text-black"><!--[--><div class="r-text flex column no-wrap transparent text-black absolute-bottom" data-v-46fc4301><h4 class="r-primary" data-v-46fc4301>情绪观察者</h4><p data-v-46fc4301>你很关注自己的情绪起伏，也很喜欢分析情绪背后的原因</p></div><!--]--></div></div></div></div></div></swiper-slide><swiper-slide data-v-06b1c7fa><div class="r-scenario-card flex row no-wrap justify-between no-scroll" style="" data-v-06b1c7fa data-v-46fc4301><div class="r-feature-img" style="width:100%;h